# Direct dependencies for scripts/render-brand-cards.py, which renders the
# brand cards from their SVG sources. Edit this file, then regenerate the
# fully pinned requirements-brand.txt:
#
#   uv pip compile --universal --python-version 3.11 requirements-brand.in \
#     -o requirements-brand.txt
#
# This pair is separate from requirements-docs.in so the documentation build
# installs no package it does not import. The brand render needs cairosvg and
# the system cairo library; nothing else in this repository imports either.
# There is deliberately no --check gate on the pair. Recompiling resolves to
# whatever is newest that day, so a drift check would go red the moment an
# upstream project published a release - the exact failure a compiled lock
# removes. Dependabot's root uv updater edits each input and recompiles its
# same-named .txt lock as a reviewed diff. PR #481 confirmed that behavior for
# the documentation pair; the same configured updater covers this pair.

cairosvg>=2.7.1
